    {
      "autoResize": false,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "height": 75,
      "id": "mwdkjcuoypjvf2",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Each row is one role, left to right: the invite, accepting it, the welcome on the place the role is about, and the role's first task. Arrows follow the buttons. One sample district; each person brings in the next, from Endless Access down to the Facilitator. Roles follow context/educator-roles.md (approved 11 Nov 2026, not built). Hover the numbered markers in each screen for the design notes.",
      "seed": 1250860009,
      "text": "Each row is one role, left to right: the invite, accepting it, the welcome on the place the role is about, and the role's first task. Arrows follow the buttons. One sample district; each\nperson brings in the next, from Endless Access down to the Facilitator. Roles follow context/educator-roles.md (approved 11 Nov 2026, not built). Hover the numbered markers in\neach screen for the design notes.",
      "textAlign": "left",
